#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:1
msgid "Spectral segment"
msgstr "光谱 segment"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:3
msgid ""
"A segment is one wavelength chunk of the spectrum.   PySME is segment-"
"aware by design: most spectral arrays are stored as a list-like object "
"with one entry per segment."
msgstr ""
"一个 segment 是光谱中按波长划分出的一个片段。PySME 在设计上就是 segment-aware 的：大多数光谱数组都以类列表对象存储，"
"其中每个 segment 对应一个条目。"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:7
msgid "Why segments exist"
msgstr "为什么需要 segments"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:9
msgid "Segments are useful when:"
msgstr "在以下情况下，segments 很有用："

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:11
msgid "your observation is naturally split into orders/chunks"
msgstr "你的观测天然就分成多个 order 或 chunk"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:12
msgid ""
"different chunks have different wavelength sampling/resolution/radial "
"velocity."
msgstr "不同 chunk 具有不同的波长采样、分辨率或径向速度。"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:13
msgid "you want to process only part of the spectrum in synthesis/solve"
msgstr "你只想在 synthesis/solve 中处理光谱的一部分"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:15
msgid "How segments are defined"
msgstr "segments 如何定义"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:17
msgid "PySME can get segment information from either:"
msgstr "PySME 可以通过以下任一方式获取 segment 信息："

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:19
msgid "`sme.wave`: explicit wavelength arrays (recommended when available)"
msgstr "`sme.wave`：显式的波长数组（如果具备，推荐使用）"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:20
msgid ""
"`sme.wran`: only segment boundaries `[[w0_start, w0_end], [w1_start, "
"w1_end], ...]`"
msgstr "`sme.wran`：只提供 segment 边界 `[[w0_start, w0_end], [w1_start, w1_end], ...]`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:22
msgid ""
"If `sme.wave` exists, it effectively defines segment boundaries.   If "
"only `sme.wran` is given, PySME synthesizes each segment within those "
"ranges."
msgstr ""
"如果存在 `sme.wave`，它实际上就定义了 segment 的边界。如果只给了 `sme.wran`，PySME 就会在这些范围内分别合成每个 "
"segment。"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:25
msgid "Segment-aware inputs"
msgstr "按 segment 处理的输入"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:27
msgid "Typical segment-aware fields are:"
msgstr "典型的按 segment 处理字段包括："

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:29
msgid "`wave`"
msgstr "`wave`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:30
msgid "`spec`"
msgstr "`spec`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:31
msgid "`uncs`"
msgstr "`uncs`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:32
msgid "`mask`"
msgstr "`mask`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:33
msgid "`synth`"
msgstr "`synth`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:34
msgid "`cont`"
msgstr "`cont`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:35
msgid "`wint` (optional transfer grid)"
msgstr "`wint`（可选的 transfer 网格）"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:36
msgid "`vrad`"
msgstr "`vrad`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:37
msgid "`cscale`"
msgstr "`cscale`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:39
msgid "You can pass these as:"
msgstr "这些字段可以按以下形式传入："

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:41
msgid "a single 1D array for one segment"
msgstr "针对单个 segment 的一个 1D 数组"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:42
msgid "a list of arrays for multiple segments"
msgstr "针对多个 segments 的数组列表"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:44
msgid "Parameters that are not segmented"
msgstr "不按 segment 划分的参数"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:46
msgid "Some model parameters are global (single value for all segments), e.g.:"
msgstr "有些模型参数是全局量（所有 segments 共用一个值），例如："

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:48
msgid "`vmic`"
msgstr "`vmic`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:49
msgid "`vmac`"
msgstr "`vmac`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:50
msgid "`vsini`"
msgstr "`vsini`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:52
msgid "Some are scalar-or-per-segment, e.g.:"
msgstr "有些参数既可以是标量，也可以按 segment 给出，例如："

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:54
msgid "`ipres`: can be one value or one value per segment"
msgstr "`ipres`：可以是一个值，也可以是每个 segment 一个值"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:55
msgid "`vrad`: handled per segment, depending on `vrad_flag`"
msgstr "`vrad`：按 segment 处理，具体方式取决于 `vrad_flag`"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:57
msgid "Choosing which segments to run"
msgstr "选择运行哪些 segments"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:59
msgid ""
"Both `synthesize_spectrum(...)` and `solve(...)` accept a `segments` "
"argument."
msgstr "`synthesize_spectrum(...)` 和 `solve(...)` 都接受一个 `segments` 参数。"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:61
msgid "`segments=\"all\"`: run all segments"
msgstr "`segments=\"all\"`：运行所有 segments"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:62
msgid "`segments=[0, 2, ...]`: run selected segments only"
msgstr "`segments=[0, 2, ...]`：只运行选定的 segments"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:64
msgid ""
"Invalid indices raise an error.   Segments that are fully masked as bad "
"pixels are skipped automatically."
msgstr "无效索引会触发报错。被完全标记为坏像素的 segments 会自动跳过。"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:67
msgid "Practical notes"
msgstr "实际注意事项"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:69
msgid "Keep segment ordering consistent across all segment-aware inputs."
msgstr "在所有按 segment 处理的输入中，segment 顺序必须保持一致。"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:70
msgid "If you provide per-segment arrays, lengths must match within each segment."
msgstr "如果你提供的是按 segment 划分的数组，那么每个 segment 内各数组的长度必须一致。"

#: ../../fundamentals/segment.md:71
msgid "For simple single-chunk workflows, using one 1D `wave` array is enough."
msgstr "对于简单的单块工作流，使用一个 1D `wave` 数组就足够了。"
